abstract: >-
  A repository of Scala/Stainless-verified proofs, from-scratch recursive
  constructions, and accompanying written articles covering integer
  division and modulo, recursively defined lists, cycles, discrete
  integrals, primality and coprimality, and sieve-sequence properties. The
  source code (src/, python/, spark/) is licensed under MIT; the written
  articles (articles/) are licensed separately under CC BY 4.0 — see
  articles/LICENSE.
